# Scene 3: model your world. stage/model.html, full bleed: one beat each for relations, time, state machines,
# operations, values and files, each broken on screen with the failure a report would give. A click on #next takes the
# page's next step; the clicks land on the narration's markers.
Import //reels/entities.reelpreset
Open ../stage/model.html

Output //.artifacts/reel/scenes/03-model.mp4
Set Browser chromium
Set Viewport 1600x900
Set Cursor off
Set ClickRipples off
Set WaitTimeout 20s

# Off camera: the fonts load, then the second Open starts every animation from its first frame.
Hide
Wait css:"#next"
Sleep 1s
Open ../stage/model.html
Wait css:"#title.on"
Show
Say "One order is where it starts. The same rules reach across your whole model."

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "Relations. Think of it as tables, and break them: a duplicate key, [dup] a reference to nothing, [ref] a cycle, [cyc] a chain of redirects. [chain]"
Wait [dup]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [ref]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [cyc]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [chain]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 1500ms

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "Time: what must follow, and how soon. [held] A request that answers in time holds. [hung] One that hangs [late] misses its deadline."
Wait [held]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [hung]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [late]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 1500ms

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "State machines: only the legal moves, [m1] walked one at a time. [nope] A move the rules don't allow is caught, [docs] and the diagram in your docs is drawn from the same definition."
Wait [m1]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 700ms
Click css:"#next"
Wait [nope]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [docs]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 1s

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "What an operation may do: [o1] cancelling twice is cancelling once, [o2] a version only goes up, [o3] a transfer keeps the total."
Wait [o1]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [o2]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [o3]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 1200ms

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "Values that can't be built invalid: [v1] good input gets a value, [v2] bad input gets every reason."
Wait [v1]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [v2]
Click css:"#next"
Sleep 1200ms

Click css:"#next"
Say@over "And the disk a model points at: [f1] a page that doesn't exist, [f2] an image that escapes its folder."
Wait [f1]
Click css:"#next"
Wait [f2]
Click css:"#next"
# A marker late in a line is found before the line ends; hold for the rest of it.
Sleep 2500ms

Click css:"#next"
Say "One model. One set of rules."
Sleep 800ms
